source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: The first `}}` is the only closer candidate and a word rune follows it, so Jira keeps the whole run literal instead of pairing with the later `}}`.
-- input.jira --
{{a}}b}}
-- rendered.html --
<p>{{a}}b}}</p>
-- want.md --
{{a}}b}}
-- warnings.json --
[]
